/** \page SYCL_EIGEN Eigen SYCL Backend

Enable the SYCL tests with `EIGEN_TEST_SYCL=ON`. DPC++ is the default
implementation; configure with a DPC++ compiler and its runtime installed.
`EIGEN_SYCL_TRISYCL=ON` selects triSYCL instead.

ComputeCpp support has been removed. Codeplay
<a href="https://codeplay.com/portal/news/2023/07/07/the-future-of-computecpp">ended ComputeCpp support in September 2023</a>
and recommends migrating to DPC++.

*/
